\* All TLC check configs for AntflyLsmReserveCleanup.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPublishWithoutReserve = FALSE
    BuggyFailureLeaksTemp = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    PublishedResourceHasCleanupReserve
    NoTempLeakAfterFailure
    Safety

==== BadFailureLeaksTemp
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyLsmReserveCleanup.tla.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPublishWithoutReserve = FALSE
    BuggyFailureLeaksTemp = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    NoTempLeakAfterFailure

==== BadPublishWithoutReserve
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyLsmReserveCleanup.tla.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPublishWithoutReserve = TRUE
    BuggyFailureLeaksTemp = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    PublishedResourceHasCleanupReserve
